cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to PHOS in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "PHOS: a declared-law operator page for industrial plants"
abstract: >-
  PHOS is a behavioural cybersecurity research project. Atlas, the engine for industrial
  plants, reads a plant's own declared laws and reports the ones that no longer hold, at
  most eight a shift, with no score, no rank and no named cause. Where the plant's own
  record cannot settle what happened, Atlas reports that it cannot and stops. This is a
  research pre-release. It has never run on a live plant, and the measurements published
  with it include the ones that failed and the detectors that were refused.
type: software
